  <section class="band band--mist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="szekcio__cim">Where an attack stops</h2>
      <p class="szekcio__lead">
        An attack is not a single event but a series of steps. The point of defense is not to have
        to step in for the first time at the last step: every step has a control that can break the
        chain on its own.
      </p>

      <figure class="abra">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 880 272" role="img" aria-labelledby="abra-lanc">
          <title id="abra-lanc">
            The five steps of a typical attack chain, with the control below each one that stops
            that step. Step one is phishing, with an email or call that is indistinguishable from
            the real thing—stopped by a written internal procedure before payments. Step two is
            signing in with a stolen password—stopped by multi-factor authentication. Step three is
            malware running on the workstation—stopped by endpoint protection and scheduled patch
            management. Step four is spreading toward the servers and the database—stopped by
            two-tier segmentation and a dedicated gateway per client. Step five is encryption of the
            data and the backup—stopped by an independent backup at another site and a ready-to-run
            replica.
          </title>

          <text class="abra__mono" x="78" y="14" text-anchor="middle">01</text>
          <text class="abra__mono" x="259" y="14" text-anchor="middle">02</text>
          <text class="abra__mono" x="440" y="14" text-anchor="middle">03</text>
          <text class="abra__mono" x="621" y="14" text-anchor="middle">04</text>
          <text class="abra__mono" x="802" y="14" text-anchor="middle">05</text>

          <rect class="abra__doboz" x="0" y="24" width="156" height="72" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__cimke" x="78" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Phishing</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="78" y="68" text-anchor="middle">email or call,</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="78" y="84" text-anchor="middle">perfectly convincing</text>
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M164 54 L176 60 L164 66 Z" />

          <rect class="abra__doboz" x="181" y="24" width="156" height="72" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__cimke" x="259" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Sign-in</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="259" y="68" text-anchor="middle">with stolen</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="259" y="84" text-anchor="middle">password</text>
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M345 54 L357 60 L345 66 Z" />

          <rect class="abra__doboz" x="362" y="24" width="156" height="72" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__cimke" x="440" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Malware</text>
