          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M707 54 L719 60 L707 66 Z" />

          <rect class="abra__doboz" x="724" y="24" width="156" height="72" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__cimke" x="802" y="50" text-anchor="middle">Ransom</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="802" y="68" text-anchor="middle">encrypting the</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="802" y="84" text-anchor="middle">data and backup</text>

          <path class="abra__vonal" d="M78 150 V110" />
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M73 110 L83 110 L78 100 Z" />
          <path class="abra__vonal" d="M259 150 V110" />
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M254 110 L264 110 L259 100 Z" />
          <path class="abra__vonal" d="M440 150 V110" />
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M435 110 L445 110 L440 100 Z" />
          <path class="abra__vonal" d="M621 150 V110" />
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M616 110 L626 110 L621 100 Z" />
          <path class="abra__vonal" d="M802 150 V110" />
          <path class="abra__nyil" d="M797 110 L807 110 L802 100 Z" />

          <rect class="abra__kiemelt" x="0" y="150" width="156" height="76" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__kontroll" x="78" y="176" text-anchor="middle">Procedure</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="78" y="194" text-anchor="middle">a written rule</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="78" y="210" text-anchor="middle">before payments</text>

          <rect class="abra__kiemelt" x="181" y="150" width="156" height="76" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__kontroll" x="259" y="176" text-anchor="middle">Multi-factor sign-in</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="259" y="194" text-anchor="middle">a password alone</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="259" y="210" text-anchor="middle">won’t do</text>

          <rect class="abra__kiemelt" x="362" y="150" width="156" height="76" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__kontroll" x="440" y="176" text-anchor="middle">PC protection</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="440" y="194" text-anchor="middle">&amp; scheduled</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="440" y="210" text-anchor="middle">patch management</text>

          <rect class="abra__kiemelt" x="543" y="150" width="156" height="76" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__kontroll" x="621" y="176" text-anchor="middle">Segmentation</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="621" y="194" text-anchor="middle">two-tier network,</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="621" y="210" text-anchor="middle">own gateway</text>

          <rect class="abra__kiemelt" x="724" y="150" width="156" height="76" rx="4" />
          <text class="abra__kontroll" x="802" y="176" text-anchor="middle">Separate backup</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="802" y="194" text-anchor="middle">at another site</text>
          <text class="abra__kicsi" x="802" y="210" text-anchor="middle">plus replica</text>

          <text class="abra__mono" x="440" y="256" text-anchor="middle">EVERY STEP HAS A CONTROL—BREAKING THE CHAIN AT ONE POINT IS ENOUGH</text>
        </svg>
      </figure>

      <p class="kulcs">
        The first two links in the chain are not technical. There, a written rule and a second of
        thought are worth more than any filter.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="szekcio__cim">Ten risks, and what we do about them</h2>
      <p class="szekcio__lead">
        These are not theoretical threats but the cases a Hungarian small or mid-sized business
        actually runs into. In every row, the link on the right takes you to where the answer is
        explained in detail.
      </p>

      <div class="tabla-doboz">
        <table class="tabla">
