  <section class="band band--mist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="szekcio__cim">Who is responsible for what</h2>
      <p class="szekcio__lead">
        Most incidents do not start where someone did poor work, but where each side assumed the
        other was taking care of it. That is why we state up front where the line runs in each
        service model.
      </p>

      <div class="tabla-doboz">
        <table class="tabla tabla--matrix">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Area</th>
